      title: "VOA 慢速风格 · Short Feature: The Pipa Meets the Blues",
      text: "A young Chinese musician recently shared a stage with an American jazz legend. She plays the pipa, a traditional Chinese instrument with four strings. He plays the blues harmonica. At first, their sounds seemed very different. The pipa is bright and quick, while the harmonica is soft and warm. But after several rehearsals, they found common ground in rhythm and emotion. The audience responded warmly. The musician said the experience taught her something important. Tradition is not a wall, she explained. It is a language, and every language can be used to say something new.",
      trans: "一位年轻的中国音乐家近日与美国爵士传奇同台演出。她弹琵琶——一种四弦的中国传统乐器；他吹蓝调口琴。起初，他们的声音听起来很不相同：琵琶明亮迅捷，口琴柔和温润。但经过几次排练，他们在节奏与情感上找到了共同点，观众反响热烈。这位音乐家说，这段经历教会了她一件重要的事：传统不是墙，而是一种语言，而任何语言都可以用来讲述新的东西。"
